{"name":"torre-monsanto","beschreibung":"Foto-Mission Torre de Monsanto (Altice-Sendeturm, 120 m, Baujahr 2001), Start auf dem gepflasterten Platz östlich des Panorâmico de Monsanto. Hoher Ring auf 118 m über Grund (120-m-Regel), also knapp unter der Spitze. Start → gerade Linie (386 m) zum Objekt, so tief wie möglich (LiDAR-Oberfläche + 8 m, Gebäude + 8 m); tiefer Ring 100 m um die Mitte in halber Objekthöhe (8 Fotos, Kamera waagerecht auf die Mitte), hoher Ring 8 m über der Spitze (8 Fotos, Blick nach unten), gleicher Weg zurück, Strecke ca. 2.0 km. Boden am Objekt liegt -15 m zum Start. Sonne um 15:00: Azimut 221°, Höhe 23° → 8 Fotos mit Sonne im Rücken, 6 im Gegenlicht. Nur tagsüber mit Sensoren.","home":{"lat":38.72852,"lon":-9.18497,"alt":198.9},"ziel":{"lat":38.72715,"lon":-9.18906,"h":120.0},"laenge_m":2285,"dauer_s":524,"punkte":[{"lat":38.72852,"lon":-9.18497,"h":42,"agl":42.0,"alt":240.9,"yaw":null,"pitch":-20,"hold":0,"speed":5,"kind":"transit","photo":false},{"lat":38.728416,"lon":-9.185438,"h":42,"agl":44.2,"alt":240.9,"yaw":null,"pitch":-20,"hold":0,"speed":5,"kind":"plan","photo":false,"notiz":""},{"lat":38.728311,"lon":-9.185906,"h":42,"agl":42.2,"alt":240.9,"yaw":null,"pitch":-20,"hold":0,"speed":5,"kind":"plan","photo":false,"notiz":""},{"lat":38.728207,"lon":-9.186374,"h":42,"agl":38.8,"alt":240.9,"yaw":null,"pitch":-20,"hold":0,"speed":4.0,"kind":"plan","photo":false,"notiz":""},{"lat":38.728103,"lon":-9.186842,"h":24,"agl":23.1,"alt":222.9,"yaw":null,"pitch":-20,"hold":0,"speed":4.0,"kind":"plan","photo":false,"notiz":""},{"lat":38.727999,"lon":-9.18731,"h":21,"agl":27.4,"alt":219.9,"yaw":null,"pitch":-20,"hold":0,"speed":4.0,"kind":"plan","photo":false,"notiz":""},{"lat":38.727894,"lon":-9.187778,"h":15,"agl":32.4,"alt":213.9,"yaw":null,"pitch":-20,"hold":0,"speed":4.0,"kind":"plan","photo":false,"notiz":""},{"lat":38.72779,"lon":-9.188246,"h":6,"agl":33.1,"alt":204.9,"yaw":null,"pitch":-20,"hold":0,"speed":4.0,"kind":"plan","photo":false,"not